WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.442
O ye Landolo ni Kalizidɛba lo ye. Lonanw ka maana dɔ.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.666
Yirisunba dɔ tun lɔnin bɛ dugu kɛrɛ fɛ; a tun kɔrɔra ka tɛmɛ cɛkɔrɔba tɔw bɛɛ kan.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.826
Landolo tun ye falatɔ ye. A tun siginin be a biranmuso fɛ.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:36.070
Taga jii ɲini. Aw ka teliya!

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.290
Deen tun be dumuni kɛra k'a wasa. Landolo kɔni tun tɛ ni foyi ye.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.920
Loon dɔ sufɛ, deen nana kasi yiriba kɔrɔ.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:23.012
O tuma na, yiri nin kununna. A y'a fɔ a ye ko: "N borow bɛɛ be falen, ka kɛ denɲumanw ye.

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:35.568
Landolo ye dumuni kɛ ani a ye barika la yiri kɔrɔman nin ye.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:46.560
Yiriba, yiriba, ne ta dɔnkiri lamɛn!

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:58.916
Lon o lon, a tun bɛ to ka dɔnkiri la. Yiri tun bɛ yuguyugu. Kanbelen nin tun be kɔgɔra.

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:20.010
A laban, a bamuso kabakoyara. A tugura a kɔ ani k'a kɔlɔsili kɛ.

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:26.260
Ne fana ka kan k'a di.

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.448
Yiri nin y'a bolow dɔrɔn le ci a ma.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:40.336
Aw ye yiri nin tigɛ ne kama!

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:44.528
A kɔsegira ni yiribaara fila ye.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.536
Nka, o y'a sɔrɔ biɲɛw tun b'a tigɛtigɛ.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:04.258
Yiri y'a daminɛ ka ŋuna. Fɔɲɔ wurira, yiriborow ka fiyɛ.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:09.500
Yiriba, i hakili sigi!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.160
O kɔ, yiri nin y'a fari faga.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:37.906
Ayiwa, sanjiba san nana se. O bɛɛ sara, fɔ yiriba min tun bɛ den di dugumɔgɔw ma.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.424
A y'a kunbiri gwan Landolo kɔrɔ ka yafa deli a fɛ.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.346
Ne b'i waleɲuman lɔn, Landolo. Ne b'i fo, yiriba.

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:13.738
Aw k'o yiri latanga. A bena o di aw ma.

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:20.056
Saan caaman o kɔ, yiri belebeleba tun be to k'a ɲɛɛ tugu.
